  "description": "Painter's sRGB8 mip filter (phase1.15_compositor-colour-fits item 2.7, decisions 219 and 225): srgb-bitmap-minification's layout on random content, whose mip chain differs between the candidate filters, where the ramp's does not. Under Legacy on the authored 4x2 plane grid at 256 px. One fill per set with only BaseColor (sRGB8) active, its source a bitmap set to sRGB, UV projection with wrap Repeat, rotation 0, offset (0, 0): the 8-bit random 256 px bitmap on s0-s3 and the 8-bit random 512 px bitmap on s4-s7; per source BilinearHQ at scale (2, 2) and (4, 4), then BilinearSharp at (2, 2) and (4, 4), so that 4 and 8 bitmap texels fall on a set texel. BaseColor at PNG 16, PNG 8 and OpenEXR 32f, infinite padding, no dithering, every export step done twice in the session.",
